# A long, round boom in the spirit of an 808 bass drum: a sine that falls from
# 190 Hz, 21 semitones up, onto A1, within a semitone of it 40 ms in, and
# rings until it is 60 dB down at 920 ms, with the little tick of its trigger
# on top. Turn release= for the length.
instrument boom {
  kick(A1, start=190hz, knee=A2, snap=6ms, body=30ms, hold=20ms, release=900ms, phase=10, click=-34db, tone=4000hz, drive=0.1) as k
  k > out
}
